      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:psephrem.asceticon.budge:24-55",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ϫⲉⲉⲕⲉⲣⲃⲟⲗ ⲛⲧϩⲉ ⲛⲟⲩϣϭⲟⲥ ⲉⲃⲟⲗ ϩⲛⲟⲩϩⲁϭⲉ ⲁⲩⲱ ⲛⲧϩⲉ ⲛⲟⲩϩⲁⲗⲏⲧ ⲉⲃⲟⲗ ϩⲛⲟⲩ**ⲡⲁϣ** ·",
      "english": "that thou mayest escape like a roe from the snare of the hunter, and like a bird from the net of the fowler.",
